1587		$(\mathrm v,i,j)\in\{\mathrm{ALine},\mathrm{DLine}\}
1588		\times\{0,\dots,m-1\}^2$ with the following two mixture properties.
1589		Sample a triple from $D_{\mathrm{dir}}$ and an independent uniform
1590		parameter $t$ on $\ell$. The law of $(\ell_X,\ell_Z,\pi_X(\ell(t)))$
1591		is the mixture obtained by sampling $(\ell_X,x)$ from
1592		$D_{\mathrm v,i}$ and independently $\ell_Z$ from the line marginal of
